FedCoRe uses Qwen3-VL model weights through Hugging Face Transformers. No Qwen
source code or model weights are redistributed in this directory. Users are
responsible for reviewing the Qwen3-VL model license and acceptable-use terms:

https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct

The optional full mode invokes NVIDIA FLARE's existing Qwen3-VL example under
examples/advanced/qwen3-vl, including its vendored-code attribution in that
example's NOTICE file.
